DESCRIPTION >
    - `projectDocReadiness` holds one AI documentation readiness result per project per run date, replicated from Postgres via Sequin.
    - `projectId` joins to `insightsProjects`.id; `projectSlug` and `projectName` are denormalised for display.
    - `docsUrl` is the documentation site that was scored; `discoveryMethod` and `confidence` say how it was found. `isOverride` = 1 when a manually submitted URL was used.
    - `overallScore` (0-100) and `overallGrade` (A-F) summarise the run; `categoryScores` is a JSON object of per-category scores as a string.
    - `ok` = 0 marks a failed run; `error` then holds the reason and the score columns are empty.
    - Take the latest `runDate` per `projectId` for the current state; older rows form the history.

TAGS "Project metadata"

SCHEMA >
    `id` String `json:$.record.id`,
    `projectId` String `json:$.record.projectId`,
    `projectSlug` String `json:$.record.projectSlug`,
    `projectName` String `json:$.record.projectName`,
    `docsUrl` String `json:$.record.docsUrl` DEFAULT '',
    `discoveryMethod` String `json:$.record.discoveryMethod` DEFAULT '',
    `confidence` String `json:$.record.confidence` DEFAULT '',
    `isOverride` UInt8 `json:$.record.isOverride` DEFAULT 0,
    `overallScore` Nullable(Int16) `json:$.record.overallScore`,
    `overallGrade` String `json:$.record.overallGrade` DEFAULT '',
    `categoryScores` String `json:$.record.categoryScores` DEFAULT '',
    `runDate` Date `json:$.record.runDate`,
    `runId` String `json:$.record.runId` DEFAULT '',
    `durationMs` Nullable(Int32) `json:$.record.durationMs`,
    `ok` UInt8 `json:$.record.ok`,
    `error` String `json:$.record.error` DEFAULT '',
    `createdAt` DateTime64(3) `json:$.record.createdAt`,
    `updatedAt` DateTime64(3) `json:$.record.updatedAt`

ENGINE ReplacingMergeTree
ENGINE_PARTITION_KEY toYear(runDate)
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY projectId, runDate
ENGINE_VER updatedAt
